  "releaseNotes": "Built-in PDF input + searchable-PDF output (no separate package); hOCR/ALTO/TSV/JSON exporters; OpenTelemetry metrics/tracing + health check; resilient resumable model downloads; automatic GPU (CUDA/DirectML/CoreML) with CPU fallback. EasyOCR parity: beam / word-beam decoders, per-box rotation, recognize-from-boxes, custom recognizers, int8 quantized models, and exposed grouping/contrast thresholds. All additive — existing APIs unchanged. See CHANGELOG.md.",
